<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-STRASBOURG WIN FRENCH LEAGUE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STRASBOURG WIN FRENCH LEAGUE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strasbourg won the French League Cup when they beat Bordeaux 6-5 on penalties in the final on Saturday.</p>
<p>The score was 0-0 after extra-time.</p>
<p>Attendance: 39,878.</p>
</text>
